  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "During the 2023 incident with the Chinese balloon over the United States, a direct emergency line to China, the \"red phone,\" was put to use. Bob Maguire, a guest the show describes as a CIA contractor, says he knows this \"for a fact\" because the Secretary of Defense and the Chairman of the Joint Chiefs, Mark Milley, said that they pick up that phone. He tells it as proof that such a hotline exists and is used when something in the sky causes trouble."
